--▀▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▀▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀

-- XD
function load_anim(animation) 
	return animation and __LA(Humanoid.Animator, animation)
end

do
	function module:GetSwordModel()
		return _Services.RepliStorage.Objects:FindFirstChild("Melee_Items"):FindFirstChild(MD_.Current_Melee_Weapon)
	end

	function module:GetGunModel()
		return _Services.RepliStorage.Objects:FindFirstChild("Guns_Items"):FindFirstChild(MD_.Current_Gun_Weapon)
	end

	function module:GetCurrentWeaponModel()
		if LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Melee" then
			return _Services.RepliStorage.Objects:FindFirstChild("Melee_Items"):FindFirstChild(MD_.Current_Melee_Weapon)
		elseif LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Gun" then
			return _Services.RepliStorage.Objects:FindFirstChild("Guns_Items"):FindFirstChild(MD_.Current_Gun_Weapon)
		end
	end

	function module:GetCurrentWeaponModelInfo()
		if LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Melee" then
			return MD_.Objects_Catalog.Melee.Items[MD_.Current_Melee_Weapon]
		elseif LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Gun" then
			return MD_.Objects_Catalog.Guns.Items[MD_.Current_Gun_Weapon]
		end
	end
end

--███████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
--█─▄▄▄─█─█─██▀▄─██▄─▄▄▀██▀▄─██─▄▄▄─█─▄─▄─█▄─▄▄─█▄─▄▄▀███─▄▄▄─█─▄▄─█▄─▀█▄─▄█─▄─▄─█▄─▄▄▀█─▄▄─█▄─▄███▄─▄███▄─▄▄─█▄─▄▄▀█
--█─███▀█─▄─██─▀─███─▄─▄██─▀─██─███▀███─████─▄█▀██─▄─▄███─███▀█─██─██─█▄▀─████─████─▄─▄█─██─██─██▀██─██▀██─▄█▀██─▄─▄█
--▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀

do
	-- Change player appearance and cloth
	function module:Change_Appearance(reset)
		local Next_Cloth_Type,Next_Charisma
		if reset then
			__Vals.Old_Cloth_Type=nil
		end
		local MyProfileFolder = _Services.RepliStorage.Characters.Profile[MD_.Current_Skin]
		if MD_.Current_Skin ~= __Vals.Old_Current_Skin then
			local CustomAnimations = MyProfileFolder:FindFirstChild("CustomAnimations")
			__Vals.Old_Current_Skin = MD_.Current_Skin
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config:Animation_Setup_Folder(CustomAnimations,true)
		end
		--██████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
		--█─▄▄▄─█─█─██▀▄─██▄─▄▄▀███─▄▄▄▄█─▄─▄─██▀▄─██─▄─▄─█▄─██─▄█─▄▄▄▄█
		--█─███▀█─▄─██─▀─███─▄─▄███▄▄▄▄─███─████─▀─████─████─██─██▄▄▄▄─█
		--▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▄▄▀
		
		if LOCAL_MD_.Health >= 4 then
			Next_Cloth_Type="Cloth"
			Next_Charisma="1_Good"
			
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.WalkAnim = nil
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.IdleAnim = nil
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.JumpAnim = nil
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.FallAnim = nil
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.BackWalkAnim = nil
			
		elseif LOCAL_MD_.Health >= 2 then
			Next_Cloth_Type="Naked_1"
			Next_Charisma="2_Meh" 
	
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.WalkAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedWalkAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.IdleAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedIdleAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.JumpAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedJumpAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.FallAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedFallAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.BackWalkAnim = nil
		else
			Next_Cloth_Type="Naked_2"
			Next_Charisma="3_Sad" 
			
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.WalkAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedWalkAnim2
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.IdleAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedIdleAnim2
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.JumpAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedJumpAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.FallAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedFallAnim
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.custom_animation.BackWalkAnim = LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.Animations.NakedBackWalkAnim
		end
		
		--██████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
		--█─▄▄▄─█─█─██▀▄─██▄─▄▄▀███▄─██─▄█▄─▄▄─█▄─▄▄▀██▀▄─██─▄─▄─█▄─▄▄─█
		--█─███▀█─▄─██─▀─███─▄─▄████─██─███─▄▄▄██─██─██─▀─████─████─▄█▀█
		--▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▀▄▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▀▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▄▄▀
		
		if __Vals.Old_Cloth_Type ~= Next_Cloth_Type then
			local FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL = MD_.FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL 

			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config:Restart_Current_Animation()
			__Vals.Old_Cloth_Type = Next_Cloth_Type
			MD_.Cloth_Type = Next_Cloth_Type
			
			if not LOCAL_MD_.ClothType then	
				local ClothType = INST("StringValue",Humanoid) 
				ClothType.Name = "ClothType_String"
				LOCAL_MD_.ClothType=ClothType
				local SkinType = INST("StringValue",Humanoid) 
				SkinType.Name = "Skin_String"
				LOCAL_MD_.SkinType=SkinType
				local VoiceType = INST("StringValue",Humanoid) 
				VoiceType.Name = "Voice_Style"
				LOCAL_MD_.VoiceType=VoiceType
				local FaceType = INST("StringValue",Humanoid) 
				FaceType.Name = "Face_Style"
				LOCAL_MD_.FaceType=FaceType
			end
			
			LOCAL_MD_.ClothType.Value = MD_.Cloth_Type
			LOCAL_MD_.SkinType.Value = MD_.Current_Skin
			LOCAL_MD_.VoiceType.Value = MyProfileFolder:GetAttribute("Voice_Style")
			LOCAL_MD_.FaceType.Value = MyProfileFolder:GetAttribute("Face_Style")
			
			if reset then
				if LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config then
					LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config.FE_Rig:Destroy()
					LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config=nil
				end
				FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL:ClearAllChildren()
			end
			if FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL:FindFirstChild("__Fake__Parts__") then
				FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL:FindFirstChild("__Fake__Parts__"):Destroy()
			end
			if not LOCAL_MD_.Lock_Bounce_Toggle then
				local Lock_Bounce_Toggle = INST("BoolValue",Character)
				Lock_Bounce_Toggle.Parent = Character
				Lock_Bounce_Toggle.Name="Lock_Bounce_Toggle" 
				LOCAL_MD_.Lock_Bounce_Toggle = Lock_Bounce_Toggle
			end
			local NoFacialToggle = LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config~=nil
			local Facial_Config = MD_.FF:Dress_My_Character({FACE_STYLE=LOCAL_MD_.FaceType.Value;SKIN_NAME=MD_.Current_Skin;CHARACTER=Character;CLOTH_TYPE=Next_Cloth_Type;NoFacial=NoFacialToggle,BouncyObjects=true,BouncyValueLock=LOCAL_MD_.Lock_Bounce_Toggle})
			if not LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config then
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config = Facial_Config
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config.FE_Rig.Parent = FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL
			else
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config.charisma = Next_Charisma
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config:Restart()
				if not reset then
					MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,{"Other_TearCloth_001","Other_TearCloth_002","Other_TearCloth_003"},{PlayOnRemove=true})
				end
			end
			
			if Character:FindFirstChild("__Fake__Parts__") then
				Character:FindFirstChild("__Fake__Parts__").Parent = FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL
			end
			LOCAL_MD_.FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL=FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL
			LOCAL_MD_.MMMAAAASSSVVV=true
			LOCAL_MD_.Restart_Sword_Back=true
			LOCAL_MD_.FF:Update_Character()
			LOCAL_MD_.FF:Viewport_Frame_Player_Top(MD_.Current_Skin,Next_Cloth_Type,Next_Charisma)
		end
	end

	-- Update Character by new appearance or change in first person mode
	function module:Update_Character()
		local function Tr(V,T)
			for i,v in pairs (V:GetDescendants()) do
				if v:IsA("BasePart") then
					if v:GetAttribute("OR_Transparency") then
						v.Transparency= (T == "OR" and v:GetAttribute("OR_Transparency")) or T
					end
				end
			end
		end
		if LOCAL_MD_.FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL then
			local Atrrname = "IS_CHANGED_BY_CHARACTER_VISIBILITY"
			local STATE = not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.CharacterVisible.LockSwitch)
			
			local function Weld_Excelsios(ConnectionWeld)
				if ConnectionWeld then
					if STATE and not ConnectionWeld:GetAttribute(Atrrname) then
						ConnectionWeld:SetAttribute(Atrrname,true) 
						ConnectionWeld.Enabled = false
						ConnectionWeld.Part1.Anchored = true
						ConnectionWeld.Part1.CFrame *= CFN(0,9999,0)
						
					elseif not STATE and ConnectionWeld:GetAttribute(Atrrname) then
						ConnectionWeld:SetAttribute(Atrrname,nil) 
						ConnectionWeld.Enabled = true
						ConnectionWeld.Part1.Anchored = false
					end
				end
			end
			local function CheckIn(V5)
				if not V5 then return end
				for i,v in pairs (LOCAL_MD_.FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL:GetDescendants()) do
					if v:GetAttribute("FP_VISIBIZLOR_ARTIFACT") == true then
						if STATE then
							Tr(v,1)
						else
							Tr(v,"OR")
						end
						local ConnectionWeld = v.Parent:FindFirstChild(v.Name ..  "_Main_Weld_")
						Weld_Excelsios(ConnectionWeld)
					end
				end
				
				local ConnectionWeld = LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config.Weld_Main_Part
				Weld_Excelsios(ConnectionWeld)
			end
			CheckIn(LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config and LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config.FE_Rig)
			CheckIn(LOCAL_MD_.FAKE_PARTS_PLAYERS_TEMPORAL)
		end
	end

	-- Hurt Character
	function module:HurtMySelf()
		LOCAL_MD_.Health = M_CL(LOCAL_MD_.Health-1,1,5)
		if LOCAL_MD_.Health <= 3 then
			Humanoid:ChangeState(Enum.HumanoidStateType.FallingDown)
		end
		LOCAL_MD_.FF:CheckHealth()
	end

	-- Masturbation Action
	function module:MMMAAAASSSVVV()
		if not __Vals.MMMAAAASSSVVV_Debounce and not MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Self.Freedom and not not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV.LockSwitch) and LOCAL_MD_.Current_Force < 8 then	
			local function change_state(s)
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Jumping,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Auto_Rotate,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN="Custom_Animation_Process",FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.FloorThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.ThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Anti_Walking,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.NoHeadRotation,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=s,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Holding,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			end change_state(true)
			__Vals.MMMAAAASSSVVV_Debounce = true
			LOCAL_MD_.MMMAAAASSSVVV = false
			LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config:AllStopAnimation(0)

			local masturbation_start,masturbation_loop = "Masturbate_Start_Alternative","Masturbate_Loop_1_Alternative"
			if MD_.Cloth_Type == "Cloth" then
				masturbation_start = "Masturbate_Start"
				masturbation_loop = "Masturbate_Loop_1"
			end
			--
			local LoadAnimation = __LA(Humanoid.Animator, LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.AnimationsFolder:FindFirstChild(masturbation_start))
			LoadAnimation:Play(.1)
			local Events = {}
			local Stopped

			MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,"Other_Movement_012",{PlayOnRemove=true})
			TA_IN(Events,LoadAnimation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("Stop"):Connect(function(value)
				Stopped = true
				LoadAnimation:AdjustSpeed(0)
				LoadAnimation:Stop()
				LoadAnimation = __LA(Humanoid.Animator, LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.AnimationsFolder:FindFirstChild(masturbation_loop))
				LoadAnimation:Play(.1)

				TA_IN(Events,LoadAnimation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("Sound"):Connect(function(value)
					MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,"Slosh_007",{PlayOnRemove=true;Search_Sound=_Services.RepliStorage.Sounds:FindFirstChild("0_Sexual_Sounds")})
				end))
			end))

			if LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config then -- if hurts, cant change expression
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config:Excited("ON")
			end
			spawn(function()
				MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Self.Freedom=true

				repeat wait() until not MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Self.Freedom or MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Scene_Config.Scene_Active or LOCAL_MD_.MMMAAAASSSVVV or not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV.LockSwitch)
				LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config:Excited("OFF")
				for i,v in pairs (Events) do v:Disconnect() v=nil end
				LoadAnimation:Stop(.1)
				MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Self.Freedom=false
				change_state(nil)
				__Vals.MMMAAAASSSVVV_Debounce=false
				LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config:Restart_Current_Animation()
			end)
		else
			MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Self.Freedom = false
		end
	end
end

--█████████████████████████████
--█─▄─▄─█─▄▄─█─▄▄─█▄─▄███─▄▄▄▄█
--███─███─██─█─██─██─██▀█▄▄▄▄─█
--▀▀▄▄▄▀▀▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀▄▄▄▄▄▀

do
	-- Sword Attack Action
	function module:SwordAttack()
		local SwordInfo = MD_.Objects_Catalog.Melee.Items[MD_.Current_Melee_Weapon]

		LOCAL_MD_.Click_Done = true
		local Stamina_Return 
		if LOCAL_MD_.StaminaAmount >= SwordInfo.Stamina then
			Stamina_Return = true
		else
			LOCAL_MD_.FF:Stamina_Required(SwordInfo.Stamina)
		end

		if not __Vals.Attack_Debounce and not not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack.LockSwitch) and Stamina_Return then
			__Vals.Attack_Debounce = true
			check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordBack,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.ThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.FloorThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Holding,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.DoubleJumping,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			
			spawn(function()
				local SwordModel = LOCAL_MD_.FF:GetSwordModel():Clone()
				SwordModel.Parent = Character
				local ATTACH_TO = Character:FindFirstChild(SwordModel:GetAttribute("ToolAttachPart"))
				SwordModel.MainPart.CFrame= ATTACH_TO.CFrame
				SwordModel.MainPart.trail.Enabled = true
				local Motor_6D = MD_.FF:Motor6D(ATTACH_TO,SwordModel.MainPart) 
				Motor_6D.Parent=SwordModel.MainPart
				local Events={}
				local SwordAnimation,tick_in_bug,StoppedAnimation
				local can_change_dicretion_tick = tick()-.2

				local function _W_e_a_k_V_a_l_u_e(WeakPointEntity)
					MD_.FF:WeakValue______({WeakPointEntity=WeakPointEntity.Value,Damage=SwordInfo.Damage,EntityTableID=MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Entity_ID,Team=MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Team,MyCharacter=Character})
				end

				local function playanim(anim)
					for i,v in pairs (Events) do v:Disconnect() v=nil end
					if not LOCAL_MD_.HurtTickCooldown and LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config then -- if hurts, cant change expression
						LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config:attack_call_event()
					end
					if SwordAnimation then SwordAnimation:AdjustSpeed(0) SwordAnimation:Stop(.1) SwordAnimation = nil end
					SwordAnimation = __LA(Humanoid.Animator, anim)
					SwordAnimation:Play(0.1)

					tick_in_bug = tick()+3

					StoppedAnimation = false
					LOCAL_MD_.FF:Stamina_Removed(SwordInfo.Stamina)

					TA_IN(Events,SwordAnimation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("Sound"):Connect(function(value)
						if sound_play_list[value] then sound_play_list[value]() end
					end))

					TA_IN(Events,SwordAnimation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("Stop"):Connect(function(value)
						SwordAnimation:AdjustSpeed(0)
						StoppedAnimation = true
					end))

					TA_IN(Events,SwordAnimation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("AttachHitbox"):Connect(function(value)
						local customhitbox = {
							CFrame=SwordModel.Hitbox.CFrame;
							Size=SwordModel.Hitbox.Size*SwordInfo.ExtraHitboxSize ;
						}
						for i,v in pairs (MD_.FF:hitbox_detector(customhitbox,1,false)) do
							if v:FindFirstChild("WeakPointEntity") then
								_W_e_a_k_V_a_l_u_e(v.WeakPointEntity)
							end
						end
					end))
				end
				
				SwordModel.Hitbox.CanTouch = true
				local TouchEvent = SwordModel.Hitbox.Touched:connect(function(part)
					if part:FindFirstChild("WeakPointEntity") then
						_W_e_a_k_V_a_l_u_e(part.WeakPointEntity)
					end
				end)
				--

				LOCAL_MD_.Click_Done = true
				repeat _Services.Run.RenderStepped:wait() 
					if not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack.LockSwitch) then break end
					if LOCAL_MD_.Click_Done and LOCAL_MD_.StaminaAmount >= SwordInfo.Stamina then
						LOCAL_MD_.Click_Done= false
						if can_change_dicretion_tick - tick() < 0 then
							can_change_dicretion_tick= tick()+ .2
							if LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.States.Falling or LOCAL_MD_.Anim_Config.States.Jumping then
								playanim(SwordModel:FindFirstChild("Sword_FlyAttack"))
							elseif not __Vals.Change_Attack_Direction then
								__Vals.Change_Attack_Direction = true
								playanim(SwordModel:FindFirstChild("Sword_Attack2"))
							else
								__Vals.Change_Attack_Direction= false
								playanim(SwordModel:FindFirstChild("Sword_Attack"))
							end
						end
					end
				until StoppedAnimation or tick_in_bug - tick() < 0

				for i,v in pairs (Events) do
					v:Disconnect()
					v=nil
				end
				
				--
				local custo_tag={Name="PREVENT_GUN_SPAM" .. tick()}
				check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,TS=custo_tag,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				delay(.2,function()
					check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,TS=custo_tag,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				end)
				--
				
				check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordBack,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.ThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.FloorThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Holding,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.DoubleJumping,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				if SwordAnimation then
					SwordAnimation:Stop()
				end
				SwordModel:Destroy()
				__Vals.Attack_Debounce = false
			end)
		end
	end

	-- Shoot Gun Action
	function module:Shoot()
		local GunModel = LOCAL_MD_.FF:GetGunModel()
		
		if GunModel and not __Vals.ShootDebounce and not not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing.LockSwitch) then
			__Vals.ShootDebounce = true
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.ThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.FloorThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.NoHeadRotation,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Holding,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.DoubleJumping,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
			spawn(function()
				local GunInfo = MD_.Objects_Catalog.Guns.Items[MD_.Current_Gun_Weapon]
				local GunModel = LOCAL_MD_.FF:GetGunModel():Clone()
				local ATTACH_TO = Character:FindFirstChild(GunModel:GetAttribute("ToolAttachPart"))
				GunModel.Parent = Character
				GunModel.MainPart.CFrame=ATTACH_TO.CFrame
				local Motor_6D = MD_.FF:Motor6D(ATTACH_TO,GunModel.MainPart) 
				Motor_6D.Parent=GunModel.MainPart
				local Equip_Loop_Animation = __LA(Humanoid.Animator, GunModel:FindFirstChild("GUN_Equip"))
				Equip_Loop_Animation:Play()

				local function Shoot_Event ()
					if not LOCAL_MD_.HurtTickCooldown and LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config then -- if hurts, cant change expression
						LOCAL_MD_.Facial_Config:attack_call_event()
					end
					MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,"Tool_Gun_Shoot_001",{PlayOnRemove=true;PlaybackSpeed=M_RAN(1250,1750)/1000})
					for i=1,GunInfo.max_bullets do
						_G.Remotes_ClientEvent:Fire("CreateBullet",{damage=GunInfo.Damage;origin=GunModel.Muzzle,direction=Human_Root.CFrame.lookVector,bullet_speed=GunInfo.BulletSpeed,ignore_descendant=Character,EntityTableID=MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Entity_ID,Team=MD_.Re_Bots[Character].Team})
					end
				end
				
				local Events = {}
				local FireRateTick,Shoot_Animation
				repeat _Services.Run.RenderStepped:wait() 
					if not_empty__switch(LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing.LockSwitch) then break end
					if not FireRateTick then
						if Shoot_Animation then Shoot_Animation:Stop(0.1) end
						for i,v in pairs (Events) do v:Disconnect() v=nil end
						FireRateTick = tick() + GunInfo.FireRate
						Shoot_Animation = __LA(Humanoid.Animator, GunModel:FindFirstChild("GUN_Shoot"))
						TA_IN(Events,Shoot_Animation:GetMarkerReachedSignal("Shoot"):Connect(Shoot_Event))
						Shoot_Animation:Play()
					elseif FireRateTick - tick() < 0 then
						FireRateTick = nil
					end
				until not LOCAL_MD_.ClickMouseButton1
				while wait() and FireRateTick do if FireRateTick and FireRateTick - tick() < 0 then break end end
				for i,v in pairs (Events) do v:Disconnect() v=nil end
				
				--
				local custo_tag={Name="PREVENT_GUN_SPAM" .. tick()}
				check__switch({BB=true,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,TS=custo_tag,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				delay(.2,function()
					check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,TS=custo_tag,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				end)
				--
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.ThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.FloorThrowYourself,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.MMMAAAASSSVVV,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.SwordAttack,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.NoHeadRotation,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.Holding,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				check__switch({BB=nil,TM=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.DoubleJumping,TS=LOCAL_MD_.Meta_Elements.GunUsing,NN=nil,FF=nil})
				if Shoot_Animation then Shoot_Animation:Stop(0.1) end
				GunModel:Destroy()
				Equip_Loop_Animation:Stop(0.1)
				__Vals.ShootDebounce = false
			end)
		end
	end

	--Switch Weapons
	function module:Switch_Weapon()
		if LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Melee" then
			LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon = "Gun" 
			MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,"UI_Equip_Gun",{PlayOnRemove=true})
		elseif LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon == "Gun" then
			LOCAL_MD_.Current_Weapon = "Melee" 	
			MD_.FF:PlaySound(Human_Root,"UI_Equip_Sword",{PlayOnRemove=true})
		end
		LOCAL_MD_.FF:SwitchWeaponUI()

		LOCAL_MD_.Restart_Sword_Back = true
	end
end

